ts, as they had in " [:a {:href "/editions/1/sports/ATH"} "1896"] ".  While in the 19th century some British meets were conducted with the runners racing clockwise, this virtually never occurred in major meets by 1906."] "\n\n" [:p {} "But it should not be construed that the 1906 Olympic Games did not constitute a major track &amp; field athletics meet.  In fact, this was the greatest international gathering of track &amp; field athletes the world had yet seen.  While some of the world’s top athletes were not in Athens, the quality of the field in 1906 far surpassed the Olympics of 1896, " [:a {:href "/editions/2/sports/ATH"} "1900"] ", and " [:a {:href "/editions/3/sports/ATH"} "1904"] "."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/56173"} "100 metres, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Intercalated"] "\n" [:td {} "25 – 27 April 1906"] "\n" [:td {} "42"] "\n" [:td {} "13"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/56190"} "400 metres, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Intercalated"] "\n" [:td {} "27 – 30 April 1906"] "\n" [:td {} "25"] "\n" [:td {} "8"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/56200"} "800 metres, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Intercalated"] "\n" [:td {} "25 April –  1 May 1906"] "\n" [:td {} "23"] "\n" [:td {} "8"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/56207"} "1,500 metres, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Intercalated"] "\n" [:td {} "27 – 30 April 1906"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n" [:td {} "9"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/56212"} "5 miles, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Intercalated"] "\n" [:td {} "25 April 1906"] "\n" [:td {} "28"] "\n" [:td {} "12"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/56213"} "Marathon, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Intercalated"] "\n" [:td {} " 1 May 1906"] "\n" [:td {} "